sequenceDiagram
    participant GateEE as Remote Gate (eu-yy01)
    participant GateFI as eFTI Gate (eu-xx01, receiving)
    participant Handler as GateMessageHandler
    participant EftiSvc as EftiService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over GateEE: Remote gate eu-yy01 has received a<br/>search request and is broadcasting to all gates.

    GateEE->>+GateFI: eDelivery AS4 / Fast HTTP: IdentifierQueryRequest
    Note over GateEE,GateFI: X-API-Key: eu-yy01<br/>Body: identifierQuery with requestId=req-b2c3d4e5,<br/>identifier=456XYZ, registrationCountryCode=FI<br/>(escaped XML body — see seq-14 source for the literal envelope)

    GateFI->>+Handler: handleMessage(payload)
    Handler->>Handler: Parse message type → IdentifierQuery

    Handler->>+EftiSvc: handleIdentifierQuery(payload)
    EftiSvc->>EftiSvc: Parse IdentifiersQuery from XML
    EftiSvc->>+DB: Local identifier search:<br/>resolve latest consignments rows matching vehicle_plate='456XYZ' AND vehicle_country='FI',<br/>keep only those whose latest status = 'active'.
    DB-->>-EftiSvc: 1 consignment (datasetId=a1b2c3d4-...)

    EftiSvc->>EftiSvc: Wrap result in identifierResponse XML
    EftiSvc-->>-Handler: identifierResponse XML with status=200, requestId=req-b2c3d4e5, ed:consignment payload

    Handler-->>-GateFI: response payload

    GateFI-->>-GateEE: eDelivery AS4 / Fast HTTP Response — identifierResponse status=200, requestId=req-b2c3d4e5

    GateEE->>GateEE: Parse GateIdentifiersResponse<br/>Extract ConsignmentXml objects<br/>Set identifierCountryOfOrigin = "FI"

    GateEE->>GateEE: send(GateIdentifiersResponse(gateId="eu-xx01", consignments=[...]))<br/>→ SSE stream to original authority user

    alt Gate unreachable / timeout
        GateEE->>GateFI: IdentifierQueryRequest
        GateFI--xGateEE: Connection timeout / error
        GateEE->>GateEE: catch(e: Exception)<br/>log.warn("eu-xx01 failed with $e")
        GateEE->>GateEE: send(GateIdentifiersResponse(gateId="eu-xx01", consignments=null, failure=e.message))<br/>→ SSE: event:gate data:{"gateId":"eu-xx01","failure":"Connect timeout"}
    end
